2 CONT several sources give a different anecstry for this Maciot. For example, Historia de Familias Cubanas gives Maciot's father as Juan Arriete Perdomo and his mother as Leonor Margarita de Béthencourt (daughter of Maciot de Bethencour
2 CONC t, governor of the Canary Isalnds). Considering the names of this Maciot's chuicldren, this ancestry has some validity but most histories prefer the lineage given here
