2 CONT Dona Brites was brought up with King João III
2 CONT
2 CONT she was the prettiest lady of the Portuguese Court, having ballads that are dedicated to her in the Cancioneiro de Garcia de Resende
2 CONT
2 CONT by the missive of 2 Dec 1526, D. João III made her a grant of the white and black soap factories of São Miguel, the same way that his brother Henrique had done and conceded other grants to her
