2 CONT 	1  NAME Francisco de /Betencourt/
2 CONT 	2  SOUR S116
2 CONT 	3  PAGE p. 100
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Nobiliário has 1582, Genea Portugal has 1562 which seems more likely
2 CONT
2 CONT The manor of the family, on the island of Terceira, was the Casa da Madre de Deus (now the Arquivo Municipal), in the freguesia of Santa Luzia. Later, in 1732, a chapel was built near it which gave rise to the entail of Madre de D
2 CONC eus	1  NMR two
2 CONT 	2  SOUR S21
2 CONT 	3  PAGE quoted in APGHS Newsletter, v. 18, no. 1 (1997), p. 19
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT There were no descendents from his second marriage according to two sources
2 CONT
2 CONT he served in Africa
