1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Dona '''Maria Gonçalves de Ávila''' (I) (Melchior, Antão, João Bethencourt, Georges, Regnault, Jean, Jean, Jean, Regnault, Philippe, Jean) (suffix added for clarification) was also known as Dona Maria de Ávila Bett
2 CONC encourt (I) suffix added for clarification. She was also known as Maria Gonçalvez de Avilla. She was born circa 1520 at São Jorge. She married Jorge de Lemos o Velho at São Jorge.
2 CONT
2 CONT Jorge de Lemos o Velho was born circa 1520 at São Jorge. Children of Dona Maria Gonçalves de Ávila (I) and Jorge de Lemos o Velho both born at São Jorge were as follows:
2 CONT
2 CONT * +  378  i.   Dona Inês Gomes de Ávila was born after 1550. She married Guilherme da Silveira Borges at Terceira.
2 CONT * +  379  ii.   Jorge de Lemos Bettencourt (I) was born after 1560. He married Joana Bettencourt de Vasconcelos, daughter of João de Bettencourt de Vasconcellos (I) and Dona Maria de Vasconcellos da Câmara, at Terceira. 
2 CONT
