2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT was condemned and executed by beheading||for being a partisan of Philip II who was born in Spain and King of Portugal. Apparently, he had ridden through the streets of Angra on horseback shouting, "Real, real, viva el-Rei Filipe, 
2 CONC rei de Castela e de Portugal."
2 CONT
2 CONT he left Madeira for Terceira with his father
