2 CONT 275. (--?--) Ávila (Maria Gonçalves de Ávila, Antão Bettencourt, João Bethencourt, Georges, Regnault, Jean, Jean, Jean, Regnault, Philippe, Jean)434,434,434 was born circa 1520.434
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of (--?--) Ávila include:
2 CONT
2 CONT +  383  i.   Dona Felipa Vaz de Ávila was born circa 1550 at São Jorge. She married Álvaro Pereira circa 1570 at Pico.
2 CONT
2 CONT In: Bettencout 1200-2000: Generation Twelve. Disp em: http://web.meganet.net/bettenco/bett0012.htm
2 CONT
2 CONT __________________________________________________________________________
2 CONT
2 CONT 383. Dona Felipa Vaz de Ávila ((?), Maria Gonçalves de Ávila, Antão Bettencourt, João Bethencourt, Georges, Regnault, Jean, Jean, Jean, Regnault, Philippe, Jean)443,434 was also known as Dona Felipa Vaz de Ávile Bettencourt .675 S
2 CONC he was also known as Filipa Vaz d' Ávila .434 She was also known as Filipa Vaz de Ávila .434 She was born circa 1550 at São Jorge.443 She was a descendant (perhaps a granddaughter) of Dona Maria Gonçalves de Ávila and Antão Fernan
2 CONC des Leal.787,434 She married Álvaro Pereira circa 1570 at Pico.787,434
2 CONT
2 CONT Álvaro Pereira787,434 was born circa 1540 at Pico.787 He resided at Pico.443,434 Children of Dona Felipa Vaz de Ávila and Álvaro Pereira all born at Faial were as follows: +  558  i.   Pedro Leal de Ávila Bettencourt was born circ
2 CONC a 1570. He married Dona Inês da Silveira Peixoto circa 1595 at Faial.
2 CONT
2 CONT     559  ii.   Catarina d'Ávila Pereira788,788,788 was born circa 1570.788 She married Manuel Brum da Silveira circa 1600.789
2 CONT
2 CONT      Manuel Brum da Silveira789 was born circa 1570 at Faial.789
2 CONT
2 CONT +  560  iii.   Antão Ávila Bettencourt was born after 1570. He married Dona Águeda Brum da Silveira at Faial.
2 CONT
2 CONT In: Bettencout 1200-2000: Generation Thirteen. Disp em: http://web.meganet.net/bettenco/bett0013.htm ________________________________________________________________________
