2 CONC m1/P81.html
2 CONT
2 CONT -------------------------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT 560. '''Antão Ávila Bettencourt''' (''Felipa Ávila, (?), Maria Gonçalves de Ávila, Antão Bettencourt, João Bethencourt, Georges, Regnault, Jean, Jean, Jean, Regnault, Philippe, Jean'') was also known as Antão d'Ávila Betencurt. He
2 CONC  was born after 1570 at Faial. He married Dona Águeda Brum da Silveira at Faial. He and Dona Águeda Brum da Silveira were the ancestors of the Brum da Silveira de Bettencourt line. He was capitão-mór at Lajes do Pico, Pico.
2 CONT
2 CONT Dona Águeda Brum da Silveira was also known as Ágada de Brum da Silveira. She was born after 1570 at Terceira. Children of Antão Ávila Bettencourt and Dona Águeda Brum da Silveira were as follows:
2 CONT *    +  779  i.   Manuel d'Ávila Bettencourt was born circa 1610 at Pico. He married Isabel Vaz da Silveira circa 1645.
2 CONT *    +  780  ii.   Águeda Pereira de Bettencourt was born circa 1610. She married João Jorge da Silveira circa 1630.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''From''' ''[http://web.meganet.net/bettenco/bett0014.htm#id20458 Bettencourts 1200-2000 - Generation Fourteen: Antão Ávila Bettencourt ], accessed 13 jul 2013.''
2 CONT
2 CONT _________________________________________________________________________________
