2 CONT 1 Carlos Iturriza Guillén, Algunas Familias Caraqueñas, Tomo I (Edición Julio 1967), Página: 201, 337. Repository: Family History Library, 35 North West Temple Street, Salt Lake City, UT 84150, USA, (801) 240-2331, Call Number:987
2 CONC .7/C1 D2i. Cit. Date: 26 Oct 2006 Surety: 3 (Catedral. Matrimonios. Libro 1, folio 50). 
2 CONT
2 CONT 2 Ibid, Página: 201, 337. Repository: Family History Library, 35 North West Temple Street, Salt Lake City, UT 84150, USA, (801) 240-2331, Call Number:987.7/C1 D2i. Cit. Date: 26 Oct 2006 Surety: 3 
