2 CONT
2 CONT View Tree for Ana Lugo y SotomayorAna Lugo y Sotomayor (b. Abt. 1660, d. date unknown) Ana Lugo y Sotomayor was born Abt. 1660, and died date unknown.She married Antonio Ramírez de Arellano Figueroa in San German, Puerto Ríco, son
2 CONC  of Lázaro Ramírez de Arellano Benavides and Clara de Figueroa Vargas. More About Ana Lugo y Sotomayor and Antonio Ramírez de Arellano Figueroa: Marriage: San German, Puerto Ríco.
2 CONT
2 CONT  Includes NotesMarriage Notes for Ana Lugo y Sotomayor and Antonio Ramírez de Arellano Figueroa: Book: Familias de Cabo Rojo
2 CONT
2 CONT -Dr. Acosta states that Brau listed these as the children of Antonio & Ana.
2 CONT
2 CONT Eugenio- Married to María del Rosario martínez de Matos<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT Germán- Married to Teresa Pabón Dávila<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT Esteban- María del Toro y Quiñones<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT Juan- Married to Ana Martínez de Matos y Espinosa<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT Sebastián- Married to Juana de Mirabal<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT Pedro- Married to Margarita Benavides<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT Petronilla- Married to José Ramos Colón<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT Andrés- Married to Juana de Rivera<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT Juana- Married to Baltazar Sepúlveda<br/>
2 CONT
2 CONT And possibly... Laurencio- Married to Antonia Martínez de Matos
2 CONT
2 CONT -Dr. Acosta makes a point that Petronila cannot be the sister of Remigiuo, but a cousin.
2 CONT
2 CONT In the marriage of Valentín Ramírez de Arellano with María Belén Ramírez de Arellano in 1819 in Cabo Rojo, she concludes that the Great-Grandmother of Valentín, Petronila, & the Great- Grandfather of Marís Belén, Eugenio...were br
2 CONC others. It indicates that Petronila was first cousin to the son of Eugenio (2º with 3º grados de Consanguinidad)- Petronila being the niece of Eugenio.
2 CONT
2 CONT -Another piece evidence she found that proved Petronila is not a sister, but a niece to Remigio, is that if Petronila is a niece of both Remigio and Eugenio- they they must be brothers.
2 CONT
2 CONT She believes there may have been a mistake in the redording of the Consanguinity in the marriage of 1819, having to do with the Great Grandparents of the bride and groom.
2 CONT
2 CONT -She concludes that Antonio has the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Remigio, Juan, Eugenio, Esteban, Juana, Laurencio
2 CONT
2 CONT and possibly these...
2 CONT
2 CONT -Baltazar, Sebastián, Pedro, Andrés
2 CONT
2 CONT Also that Germán was a first cousin, and Petronila is the niece of Remigio & Eugenio & not a sister.
2 CONT
2 CONT Source:Ursula Acosta & David E. Cuesta Camacho, Familias de Cabo Rojo,(1st Edition, 1983). Pg 92-93
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Ana Lugo y Sotomayor and Antonio Ramírez de Arellano Figueroa are:
2 CONT
2 CONT +Bernardo Ramirez de Arellano de Lugo, b. Abt. 1669, San German, Puerto Ríco, d. Abt. 1739, San German, Puerto Ríco. Germán Ramirez de Arellano de Lugo, b. Abt. 1710, San German, Puerto Ríco, d. date unknown. Eugenio Ramirez de Ar
2 CONC ellano de Lugo, b. Abt. 1692, San German, Puerto Ríco, d. date unknown. +Remigio Ramirez de Arellano de Lugo, b. Abt. 1693, San German, Puerto Ríco, d. Abt. 1766. +Juana Ramirez de Arellano de Lugo, b. Abt. 1705, San German, Puert
2 CONC o Ríco, d. date unknown. Andrés Ramirez de Arellano de Lugo, d. date unknown. Sebastián Ramirez de Arellano de Lugo, d. date unknown. Juan Ramirez de Arellano de Lugo, b. Abt. 1682, San German, Puerto Ríco, d. 07 May 1763, San Jua
2 CONC n, Puerto Ríco. +Esteban Ramirez de Arellano de Lugo, b. Abt. 1705, San German, Puerto Ríco, d. 11 Jan 1797, San German, Puerto Ríco. +Laurencio Ramirez de Arellano de Lugo, d. Abt. 1786, Sabana Grande, Puerto Ríco. Baltazar Ramir
2 CONC ez de Arellano de Lugo, b. Abt. 1680, San German, Puerto Ríco, d. date unknown. Francisco Ramirez de Arellano de Lugo, d. date unknown. Pedro Ramirez de Arellano de Lugo, d. date unknown.
2 CONT
