1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Jose de Llarena Calderon y Valcarcel II was born in La Laguna. He married in 1643* with Maria de Ponte. He signed his last will in 1647.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was chief of the Houses of Llarena, Calderon and Valcarcel, patron of the Monastery of Santa Clara of the order of San Francisco (La Orotava) and the Chapel of San Pedro in the Church of Our Lady of the Conception (Ntra. Sra. d
2 CONC e la Concepcion), also in La Orotava.
