2 CONT * [http://gw1.geneanet.org/genealogias?lang=en;p=luis;n=lasso+de+la+vega+y+manrique+de+lara ''' Luis Lasso de la Vega y Manrique de Lara''']
2 CONT * M  - Luis Lasso de la Vega y Manrique de Lara
2 CONT * Duque del Arco (2nd), Grande de España (2nd), Conde de Puertollano and de Montehermoso (5th), Marqués de Miranda de Auta (9th)
2 CONT * Born - 19 September 1699
2 CONT *  Died - 29 August 1768 , age at death: 68 years old
