1 CONT Felipa de TROYES 352,353,354 was also known as Felipora de Trope.355 She was also known as Felipa de Froyes.356 She was also known as Phillipote de Troyes.357,358 She was also known as Philipotte de Troyes.359 She was also known a
1 CONC s Philippote de Troyes.360 She was also known as Phillipa de Troyes.361 She was born before 1370 in France.362,363
