1 CONT Inês Margarida de BETHENCOURT (Maciot8, Regnault7, Jean6, Jean5, Jean4, Regnault3, Philippe2, Jean1);638 born illegitimate circa 1420 in the Canary Islands;639 married Jean Arriete Prud'homme in the Canary Islands.640
1 CONT She was also known as Leonor de Bethencourt.641 She and Jean Arriete Prud'homme were the ancestors of the Bethencourts of the Canary Islands (Lanzarote).642 She left a will on 4 Jun 1480 in her husband's house in Arrieta, Lanzarot
